OL,3,GNEWSAInjured biker asks if a road sign
OL,4,Achange could save lives
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis campaign comes after Department for
OL,7,FTransport (DfT) figures showed about
OL,8,Fhalf of all casualties in Great Britain
OL,9,Foccurred at or within 20 metres (22
OL,10,Fyards) of a junction. The DfT has been
OL,11,Fapproached for comment.
